# =====================================================================
# Release V067 -- Metric target controls + activation edits
# =====================================================================
# Adds two nullable columns to Config.Metric_Definitions:
#   Has_Target                 -- 0 = no separate target (excluded from the targets
#                                 template); NULL/1 = has a target.
#   Target_Practitioner_Roles  -- CSV of roles a practitioner target applies to
#                                 (NULL = all supported). e.g. exam_ratio -> 'Dentist'.
# Post-seed adjustments (in the Data.sql):
#   Is_Active=0  : revenue_per_dentist_hour, acceptance_rate, days_until_1hr_free  (cut)
#   Has_Target=0 : lapsed_deactivated, lapsed_calculated  (roll up into lapsed_patients)
#   exam_ratio   : Target_Practitioner_Roles='Dentist'
# Generate_Targets_Template.py now filters on Is_Active=1 AND Has_Target<>0 and only
# emits practitioner rows for the scoped roles.
#
# DEPLOY THIS BEFORE re-running Generate_Targets_Template.py (it reads the new columns).
# Table.sql DROP/CREATEs then Data.sql re-seeds (MERGE) + applies the adjustments.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V067__metric_target_controls.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Config.Metric_Definitions.Table.sql
DEPLOY  Fabric\Config.Metric_Definitions.Data.sql

TEST
